{"id":"ea7158d315318373","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-hardness-derandomization.md","title":"平均及最坏困难性到去随机化PRG","display":"thm-hardness-derandomization — 平均及最坏困难性到去随机化PRG","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-hardness-derandomization","aliases":["28-thm-hardness-derandomization"],"display":"thm-hardness-derandomization — 平均及最坏困难性到去随机化PRG","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]","[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]","[[28-df-time-constructible]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorems 20.6–20.7 and Remark 20.8","source_printed_pages":"407","source_pdf_pages":"433","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-boundary-recorded","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"source-statement-only","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-hardness-derandomization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-hardness-derandomization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hardness-derandomization — 平均及最坏困难性到去随机化PRG"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc596ec4c1021296\" href=\"?note=fc596ec4c1021296\" title=\"28-df-derandomization-prg\">28-df-derandomization-prg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorems 20.6–20.7 and Remark 20.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"407"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"433"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-boundary-recorded"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-only"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_n=f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n\">\\(f_n=f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a> 中总节点数电路硬度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DPRG}\">\\(\\operatorname{DPRG}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc596ec4c1021296\" href=\"?note=fc596ec4c1021296\" title=\"28-df-derandomization-prg\">28-df-derandomization-prg</a> 的渐近定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM},M(x),\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{TM},M(x),\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\)</span> 也由后者的直接机器接口确定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 为比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 对应的单字符输出串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[M(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le2^{c(|x|+1)}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[M(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le2^{c(|x|+1)}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\le k\\Rightarrow S(n)\\le S(k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\le k\\Rightarrow S(n)\\le S(k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,\\lfloor S(\\lfloor\\delta\\ell\\rfloor)^\\delta\\rfloor\\}\\qquad(0&lt;\\delta&lt;1,\\;\\ell\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,\\lfloor S(\\lfloor\\delta\\ell\\rfloor)^\\delta\\rfloor\\}\\qquad(0&lt;\\delta&lt;1,\\;\\ell\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\land\\left[\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)\\ge S(n)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\land\\left[\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)\\ge S(n)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\land\\left[\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)\\ge S(n)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ExpBool}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Mon}(S)\\land\\left[\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)\\ge S(n)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{Stretch}_{S,\\delta}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorems 20.6–20.7 的陈述记录，采用标准取整、允许有限长度例外以及本目录的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(\\ell)}\">\\(2^{O(\\ell)}\\)</span> 计算界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpBool}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpBool}\\)</span> 在这里显式给出，等价于布尔函数的单指数确定性可计算性；没有把语言类 DTIME 直接当作函数类。\n证据边界：本次逐项核对了印刷 p.407 / PDF p.433 的两个定理陈述和 Remark 20.8，没有完整复核 Umans 的全参数构造或从第19章强困难性放大到第二式的完整证明。Remark 20.8 明说书内证明较弱的 NW 参数版，全参数 Theorem 20.6 归于 Umans。因此本节点标为 source-statement-only，禁止作为已核验的证明依赖；它仍可作为有明确来源及限制的定理记录。\n原书印刷 p.412 / PDF p.438 的汇总同时出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{d/5}\">\\(2^{d/5}\\)</span> 个集合、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\log_2S(n)/10\">\\(d=\\log_2S(n)/10\\)</span> 和输出前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(n)^{1/40}\">\\(S(n)^{1/40}\\)</span> 位的要求：前两者给出的输出数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(n)^{1/50}\">\\(S(n)^{1/50}\\)</span>，不足以截取所要求的位数；且与 Lemma 20.14 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{d/10}\">\\(2^{d/10}\\)</span> 不一致。本次未将该汇总段作为证明使用，有限 NW 机制另由本目录明确条件的重构引理支持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-hardness","status":"resolved","id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-derandomization-prg","status":"resolved","id":"fc596ec4c1021296","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-time-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma$；$f_n=f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n$；$S\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，其中 $\\mathrm{TC}$ 见 [[28-df-time-constructible]]。\n$H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)$、$H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)$ 使用 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]] 中总节点数电路硬度；$\\oper